    "detailed_description": "Instance Destroy is a bite sized metroidvania (Around 5 - 7 hours).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy play this one?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn depth combat with the ability to juggle and toss around enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind furniture to decorate your room / upgrade your character. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate elemental weapons.<br />\r\nUsing elemental weapons too much changes the levels. (Using an ice knife causes snow and ice to fill the level and augment the enemies)<br />\r\nHaving different elements active will allow you to take different paths through the levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry mixing and matching elements to create unique weapon effects.",
